cide lucide-sparkles text-active size-6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"></path><path d="M20 2v4"></path><path d="M22 4h-4"></path><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"></circle></svg><div class="text-sm font-semibold">Ask about this client</div><p class="text-muted-foreground max-w-md text-xs leading-relaxed">Answers come from the spec, the live ClickUp board and the decision log. It can propose changes — nothing reaches ClickUp until you confirm the card, and it never sends a message.</p><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2"><button type="button" class="border-border text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground hover:border-active/50 rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-xs transition-colors">What is currently blocked, and on whom?</button><button type="button" class="border-border text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground hover:border-active/50 rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-xs transition-colors">Summarize this client&#x27;s status.</button><button type="button" class="border-border text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground hover:border-active/50 rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-xs transition-colors">Draft a message to Jaffer about what&#x27;s stuck.</button></div></div><div></div></div><form class="border-border bg-card sticky bottom-3 flex items-end gap-2 rounded-xl border p-2"><textarea rows="1" placeholder="Ask, or describe a task to create…" class="text-foreground max-h-40 min-h-9 flex-1 resize-none bg-transparent px-2 py-1.5 text-sm outline-none"></textarea><button type="submit" disabled="" aria-label="Send" class="bg-active inline-flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-white transition-opacity disabled:opacity-40"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" wid